        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a quest to catch the mythical wish granting fish - The Wonderfish!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>•80 unique fish to catch, 5 environments to explore, and multiple rods, lures, and bait to collect and use to land your next catch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras/d62779c524caa99d1b88115a0616808c.avif?t=1765426469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras_big/d62779c524caa99d1b88115a0616808c.webp?t=1765426469 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>•3 methods of fishing to master in your quest - bait fishing, lure fishing, and ocean trolling.  Gather equipment and unique items to access new areas and increase your fishing ability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras/4f5d07d163a5a385ae27ed196da2cb2d.avif?t=1765426469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras_big/4f5d07d163a5a385ae27ed196da2cb2d.webp?t=1765426469 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>•Hone your skills by tracking down and reeling in the River King, Lake King, and Ocean King to prove your worth as an Angler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras/9e529584b176dc979c47dcdcd5084e8f.avif?t=1765426469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras_big/9e529584b176dc979c47dcdcd5084e8f.webp?t=1765426469 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a quest to catch the mythical wish granting fish - The Wonderfish!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>•80 unique fish to catch, 5 environments to explore, and multiple rods, lures, and bait to collect and use to land your next catch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras/d62779c524caa99d1b88115a0616808c.avif?t=1765426469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras_big/d62779c524caa99d1b88115a0616808c.webp?t=1765426469 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>•3 methods of fishing to master in your quest - bait fishing, lure fishing, and ocean trolling.  Gather equipment and unique items to access new areas and increase your fishing ability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras/4f5d07d163a5a385ae27ed196da2cb2d.avif?t=1765426469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras_big/4f5d07d163a5a385ae27ed196da2cb2d.webp?t=1765426469 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>•Hone your skills by tracking down and reeling in the River King, Lake King, and Ocean King to prove your worth as an Angler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras/9e529584b176dc979c47dcdcd5084e8f.avif?t=1765426469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104970/extras_big/9e529584b176dc979c47dcdcd5084e8f.webp?t=1765426469 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
